Z||000000||JohnF||12-05-2001||06:55 PM||||Prowling around in a j/y today, I ran across a 3300 in an early '90s model Cutlass S Calais.  3300 was very prominently engraved on the intake as is our "Fiero" logo.<P>Now to the question.  We often discuss 2.8 (or 2.9 from Ed Parks), 3.1, 3.4, 3800(+) and up.  What is the problem with a 3300? <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=56509969&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||mrfiero||12-05-2001||06:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnF:<BR><B>What is the problem with a 3300? <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>A 3300 is essentially a destroked 3800, so it would require the same modifications to install as a 3800, but with less displacement and power.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Standard||12-05-2001||08:35 PM||||yeah, it's a 90* v6.  Just as much work to swap as the 3800, but with less power.  Not worth it.. unless it runs really good and you can get it for under 10 bucks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000003||zeelebuba||12-05-2001||10:52 PM||||  Yes the 2.8,3.1,3.4 are all members of the 60 degree family, where 3300,3800 are 90 degree engines.<P>  The 90 are a little more stout,design is based on small blck chevy i think.<BR> I have one in my fiero check this topic<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015970.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015970.html</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||BtotheB||12-05-2001||11:17 PM||||My parents used to have a '92 Buick Century Wagon with the 3300 V6 in it.  It was rated at 160 HP, I believe.  Not a bad engine, of course it was in a station wagon though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
